  "My unusual café is called “Storm Chasers’ Café.”",
  "It is located on the outskirts of Dodge City, in the state of Kansas, USA.",
  "It is surrounded by fields.",
  "It is a good place to watch storms because the land is flat and Kansas is in Tornado Alley.",
  "The café has large windows made of thick glass.",
  "Through the windows, you can admire the Great Plains and get a clear view of the sky.",
  "Guests can see storm clouds, lightning, and tornadoes in the distance, both during the day and at night.",
  "There are also other attractions inside.",
  "You can see a weather radar and learn how it works.",
  "There is also a demonstration of how a whirlpool forms.",
  "Guests have fun and learn about the weather.",
  "When a tornado comes near the café, everyone goes to the shelter.",
  "You can order cake, cookies, and pizza, and drink coffee or juice.",
  "The café is open 24 hours a day, from Monday to Friday.",
  "It is closed on Saturdays and Sundays."
 ],
